Z||000000||DecadenceR||08-12-2001||07:53 AM||||Well gang, it's 7:50 and I'm up early as hell to get my rear end to Ozzfest at the PNC Bank Arts Center here in NJ. I kinda liked the idea a little better when I went in 97 and they started at 12. I could get more sleep. LOL<BR>Anyway, it should be an interesting day. We have lawn seats, and it's supposed to rain today. So I may become a soaked young man. But hopefully it'll all be worth it. I'm definitely looking foward to seeing Disturbed, Linkin Park, and Black Sabbath.<BR>YOu all have a good day today too!||||reg||1
