Z||000002||FieroSTETZ||08-12-2001||12:57 PM||||you lucky guy, i just went a few weeks ago when they were here, i wish it woulda rained! it was 108 and there is no shade, plus 6.50 for a cup of WARM water- ozzy rules man! a coworker of mine went, and left right before ozzy... had to kick him for skipping ozzy at ozzfest- have fun dood!<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.shawnrocks.com/Animation1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||DecadenceR||08-13-2001||01:08 AM||||Just got back a little while ago. I had SUCH a blast!!! Today was so random...<BR>Got mad free t-shirts for stupid **** , almost knocked over one of the members of Drowning Pool but then got them to sign a CD, some girl came up and was talknig to me, and all of a sudden started kissing me. Didn't mind that a bit. Of course it poured like 4 times, but not for long. Then, there was the huge mud fight. i came home covered in mud. All in all, I had such a good time. All the bands were awsome, and it was great to see Disturbed, Linkin Park, and Manson for the first time. and as always it was amazing to see Ozzy once again.<BR>Gotta go again next year!!!!!||||reg||1
